  "contentHtml": "<p>거의 이 활동만 3~4시간동안 한 것 같습니다 ㅎㅎ 진도가 여유로워서요</p><p>선생님 덕분에 저도 잘 활용하고 아이들도 마지막 칠판 사진을 보며 뿌듯해 했답니다!!&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/990F6F455DA144BD04\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20191010_152903.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"640\"  id=\"A_990F6F455DA144BD0410EB\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/993E7E455DA144BF03\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20191010_152946.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"640\"  id=\"A_993E7E455DA144BF039B1D\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99FBCB455DA144C009\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20191010_154302.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"640\"  id=\"A_99FBCB455DA144C009A512\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99DA5B455DA144C10A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20191010_154317.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"640\"  id=\"A_99DA5B455DA144C10A5E92\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99F950455DA144C209\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20191010_154513.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"640\"  id=\"A_99F950455DA144C209E9E3\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/993449455DA144C406\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20191010_154603.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"640\"  id=\"A_993449455DA144C40616DA\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99DDC8455DA144C50A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20191010_155202.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"640\"  id=\"A_99DDC8455DA144C50AF60D\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&lt;수업흐름&gt;</p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D104%26fileid%3D9%26regdt%3D20191012121402&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile260.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F9991193B5DCB8AFA0276FC')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 1학년 학습지.hwp</a></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">◎ 1차시 : 직업조사 후 발표하기 + 친구와 공유하기 (학습지 2쪽 숙제, 3쪽 활동)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong></strong>◎ 2차시 : 직업카드 만들기 ( 학습지 4쪽에 2번에 도안 그려보고,&nbsp; A4 반쪽 색깔별로 받아가서 한 후 제출)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">◎ 3차시 : 핵심 역량에 대해 어떻게 생각하는지 조원끼리 사인펜 주고 하나씩 적어보며 역량에 대해 토의하기</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D104%26fileid%3D10%26regdt%3D20191012121402&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile294.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F991CF13B5DCB8AFB2FBD02')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 핵심역량 조원 탐구 자료.hwp</a></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99F5B0375DCB8A7F01\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; font-size: 9pt; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20191113_134402.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_99F5B0375DCB8A7F01976B\"/><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">◎ 4차시 : 역량 피자판 하나씩 작성 + 융합/ 다문하/ 고령화 작은 단어 카드 중에 자신의 직업에 알맞는 키워드 붙이기</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 다 작성한 직업카드는 칠판에~</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
